1
00:00:00,854 --> 00:00:03,115
As Uke comes forward and take your wrist

2
00:00:03,116 --> 00:00:05,435
slide your front foot forward slightly,

3
00:00:05,936 --> 00:00:09,413
holding his wrist
pivot your body completely towards his rear

4
00:00:09,414 --> 00:00:12,592
turn all the way around, raising the arm up
and cutting Uke down,

5
00:00:12,593 --> 00:00:16,087
placing him down in front of you.

